with the plan that it had created.

12
00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:48.181
Execution efficiency sits at the
intersection between goal and action,

13
00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:52.986
and measures whether the execution trace
is an efficient one,

14
00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:57.924
that is, that it's an optimal path
for achieving the agent's goal.

15
00:00:58.091 --> 00:01:03.091
And finally, logical consistency sits
at the intersection of all three of goal

16
00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:08.596
planning action looks for inconsistencies
between plans, planning steps,

17
00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:14.536
or between planning steps and action steps
within action steps as well.

